  "summary": {
    "en": "The frame of an app: a sticky sidebar beside the content on wide screens, a top bar with a drawer below 960 px. One per app, at the root; one highlight glides to the current page.",
    "id": "Kerangka sebuah aplikasi: sidebar sticky di samping konten pada layar lebar, top bar dengan drawer di bawah 960 px. Satu per aplikasi, di root; satu sorotan meluncur ke halaman aktif."
  },
  "titleId": "App shell",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A service portal frame",
        "desc": "Flat links, a group caption, a badge and a foot. Pick a link: the highlight glides to it. Below 960 px the sidebar becomes a drawer behind the menu button. The demo is boxed to 460 px; a real shell fills the viewport.",
        "html": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell style=\"min-height: 0; height: 460px;\" onclick=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\" onkeyup=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\">\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"as1-side\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"#as1-main\">Layanan Warga</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Main\" onclick=\"const a = event.target.closest('a'); if (!a) return; event.preventDefault(); this.querySelectorAll('[aria-current]').forEach((x) => x.removeAttribute('aria-current')); a.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Home</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Schedule</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">assignment</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Applications</span><span class=\"badge badge--accent shell__badge\">3</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Services</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Micro business permit</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Domicile letter</span></a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"shell__foot\">\n      <button class=\"shell__link\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Settings</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-controls=\"as1-side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"const s = this.closest('.shell'); const o = !s.classList.contains('is-menu'); s.classList.toggle('is-menu', o); if (o) s.querySelector('.shell__side a').focus();\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Applications</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"as1-main\" style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n      <h2 class=\"section__title-sm\">Applications</h2>\n      <p class=\"section__sub\">Three are still open. The nearest deadline is Friday at 23:59.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell>\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"side\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"/\">Layanan Warga</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Main\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Home</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/schedule\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Schedule</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/applications\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">assignment</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Applications</span><span class=\"badge badge--accent shell__badge\">3</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Services</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/services/micro-business\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Micro business permit</span></a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"shell__foot\">\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/settings\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Settings</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-shell-toggle aria-controls=\"side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Applications</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <main id=\"main\">…</main>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Nested sections with numbered topics",
        "desc": "Sections fold open on a spring; the one holding the current page opens by itself. A parent link carries numbered children on a rail; finished ones get a done mark. Open and close Family health.",
        "html": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell style=\"min-height: 0; height: 520px;\" onclick=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\" onkeyup=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\">\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"as2-side\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"#as2-main\">Kelas UMKM</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Topics\" onclick=\"const a = event.target.closest('a'); if (!a) return; event.preventDefault(); this.querySelectorAll('[aria-current]').forEach((x) => x.removeAttribute('aria-current')); a.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Overview</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Topics</p>\n      <div class=\"shell__section\">\n        <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"as2-s1\"><span class=\"shell__section-label\">Business bookkeeping</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">5</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n        <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"as2-s1\"><div>\n          <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"#as2-main\">Module 1: Cash flow</a>\n          <div class=\"shell__children\">\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Recording income</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Done</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Recording expenses</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Done</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Separating business and personal money</span></a>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"#as2-main\">Module 2: Permits</a>\n          <div class=\"shell__children\">\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Business ID number (NIB)</span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Halal certificate</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shell__section\">\n        <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"as2-s2\"><span class=\"shell__section-label\">Family health</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">3</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n        <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"as2-s2\"><div><div class=\"shell__children\">\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Balanced nutrition</span></a>\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Immunization schedule</span></a>\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Clean water at home</span></a>\n        </div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-controls=\"as2-side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"const s = this.closest('.shell'); const o = !s.classList.contains('is-menu'); s.classList.toggle('is-menu', o); if (o) s.querySelector('.shell__side a').focus();\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Separating business and personal money</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"as2-main\" style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n      <h2 class=\"section__title-sm\">Separating business and personal money</h2>\n      <p class=\"section__sub\">Topic 3 of Module 1. Two of three topics in this module are done.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Topics\">\n  <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <div class=\"shell__section\">\n    <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec-books\">\n      <span class=\"shell__section-label\">Business bookkeeping</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">5</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"sec-books\"><div>\n      <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow\">Module 1: Cash flow</a>\n      <div class=\"shell__children\">\n        <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow/1\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Recording income</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Done</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow/3\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Separating business and personal money</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n</nav>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Admin frame with an app bar and a rail",
        "desc": "Press the panel button in the bar: the sidebar folds to its icons and the choice is remembered. Hover an icon for its name; move down the rail and the tooltip follows at once. Below 960 px the same bar shows the menu button and the sidebar becomes the drawer.",
        "html": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell style=\"min-height: 460px; height: 460px;\">\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"adm-side\" style=\"height: 460px;\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"#adm\"><span class=\"shell__mark\">K</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Kelola admin</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Main\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Dashboards</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#adm\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">dashboard</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Overview</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#adm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">payments</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Finance</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Pages</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#adm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">group</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Users</span><span class=\"badge badge--accent shell__badge\">3</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#adm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">view_kanban</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Kanban</span></a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"shell__foot\">\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#adm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">help</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Help</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__bar\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-shell-toggle aria-controls=\"adm-side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-shell-rail aria-controls=\"adm-side\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Collapse sidebar\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">left_panel_close</span></button>\n      <span class=\"sep sep--v\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"crumbs\"><li><a href=\"#adm\">Dashboards</a></li><li><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Overview</span></li></ol></nav>\n      <div class=\"shell__bar-end\">\n        <button class=\"control search shell__search\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">search</span>Search<span class=\"kbd\">⌘K</span></button>\n        <button class=\"icon-btn shell__search-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Search\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">search</span></button>\n        <button class=\"icon-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Notifications, 2 unread\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">notifications</span><span class=\"count\">2</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <main style=\"padding: 24px;\"><p class=\"section__sub\">Page content.</p></main>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Multi-page app: the frame stays still between pages",
        "desc": "When every page is its own HTML file (the example dashboard), three pieces keep the frame from jumping: a paint-time snippet right after `</aside>` that restores the sidebar scroll and places the highlight before the first paint, gliding it from the link you left; one `@view-transition` rule so the sidebar and bar stay put while the content cross-fades; and `data-lds-shell`, which writes both keys on `pagehide`. Follow two links in the example dashboard (`docs/examples/dashboard/`) to see it.",
        "html": "<p class=\"docs-note\">Needs real page loads, so there is no live demo here. Copy the snippet and the rule from the code below; the dashboard in docs/examples uses exactly this.</p>",
        "code": "<!-- 1. Once per site, in your stylesheet (opt in to cross-document transitions) -->\n<style>@view-transition { navigation: auto; types: lds-page; }</style>\n\n<!-- 2. In every page, the snippet comes right after the sidebar, before anything else paints -->\n<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell>\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"side\" aria-label=\"Sidebar\">\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Main\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"default.html\" aria-current=\"page\">…</a>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n  <script>(function(){try{var s=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling,ss=sessionStorage,v=ss.getItem('lds-shell-scroll');if(v!=null)s.scrollTop=+v;s.setAttribute('data-restored','');var n=s.querySelector('.shell__nav'),h=s.querySelector('.shell__hl'),c=n&&n.querySelector('[aria-current=\"page\"]'),f=ss.getItem('lds-shell-from');ss.removeItem('lds-shell-from');if(!h||!c||c.closest('.shell__panel:not(.is-open)'))return;var put=function(e){h.style.height=e.offsetHeight+'px';h.style.transform='translateY('+e.offsetTop+'px)';},o=null;if(f){[].forEach.call(n.querySelectorAll('a[href]'),function(a){if(a.getAttribute('href')===f)o=a;});}h.style.transition='none';if(o&&!o.closest('.shell__panel:not(.is-open)')&&!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches){put(o);h.offsetWidth;h.style.transition='';requestAnimationFrame(function(){put(c);});}else put(c);n.classList.add('has-hl');}catch(e){}})();</script>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">…</div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kerangka portal layanan",
        "desc": "Tautan datar, keterangan grup, badge, dan kaki. Pilih sebuah tautan: sorotan meluncur ke sana. Di bawah 960 px sidebar menjadi drawer di balik tombol menu. Demo dikotakkan setinggi 460 px; shell sungguhan mengisi viewport.",
        "html": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell style=\"min-height: 0; height: 460px;\" onclick=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\" onkeyup=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\">\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"as1-side\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"#as1-main\">Layanan Warga</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Utama\" onclick=\"const a = event.target.closest('a'); if (!a) return; event.preventDefault(); this.querySelectorAll('[aria-current]').forEach((x) => x.removeAttribute('aria-current')); a.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Beranda</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Jadwal</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">assignment</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Permohonan</span><span class=\"badge badge--accent shell__badge\">3</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Layanan</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Izin usaha mikro</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as1-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Surat domisili</span></a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"shell__foot\">\n      <button class=\"shell__link\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Pengaturan</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-controls=\"as1-side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"const s = this.closest('.shell'); const o = !s.classList.contains('is-menu'); s.classList.toggle('is-menu', o); if (o) s.querySelector('.shell__side a').focus();\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Permohonan</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"as1-main\" style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n      <h2 class=\"section__title-sm\">Permohonan</h2>\n      <p class=\"section__sub\">Tiga masih terbuka. Tenggat terdekat hari Jumat pukul 23.59.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell>\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"side\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"/\">Layanan Warga</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Utama\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Beranda</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/schedule\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Jadwal</span></a>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/applications\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">assignment</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Permohonan</span><span class=\"badge badge--accent shell__badge\">3</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Layanan</p>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/services/micro-business\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">menu_book</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Izin usaha mikro</span></a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"shell__foot\">\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"/settings\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Pengaturan</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-shell-toggle aria-controls=\"side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Permohonan</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <main id=\"main\">…</main>\n  </div>\n</div>"
