      {
        "title": "Bagian bersarang dengan materi bernomor",
        "desc": "Bagian terbuka dengan spring; bagian yang memuat halaman aktif terbuka sendiri. Tautan induk membawa anak bernomor di atas rel; yang selesai mendapat tanda selesai. Buka dan tutup Kesehatan keluarga.",
        "html": "<div class=\"shell\" data-lds-shell style=\"min-height: 0; height: 520px;\" onclick=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\" onkeyup=\"const t = this.querySelector('.shell__top .icon-btn'); t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(this.classList.contains('is-menu')));\">\n  <aside class=\"shell__side\" id=\"as2-side\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n    <a class=\"shell__brand\" href=\"#as2-main\">Kelas UMKM</a>\n    <nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Materi\" onclick=\"const a = event.target.closest('a'); if (!a) return; event.preventDefault(); this.querySelectorAll('[aria-current]').forEach((x) => x.removeAttribute('aria-current')); a.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\">\n      <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <a class=\"shell__link\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">home</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Ringkasan</span></a>\n      <p class=\"shell__group\">Topik</p>\n      <div class=\"shell__section\">\n        <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"as2-s1\"><span class=\"shell__section-label\">Pembukuan usaha</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">5</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n        <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"as2-s1\"><div>\n          <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"#as2-main\">Modul 1: Arus kas</a>\n          <div class=\"shell__children\">\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Mencatat pemasukan</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Selesai</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Mencatat pengeluaran</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Selesai</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Memisahkan uang usaha dan pribadi</span></a>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"#as2-main\">Modul 2: Perizinan</a>\n          <div class=\"shell__children\">\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Nomor induk berusaha</span></a>\n            <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Sertifikat halal</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shell__section\">\n        <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"as2-s2\"><span class=\"shell__section-label\">Kesehatan keluarga</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">3</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n        <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"as2-s2\"><div><div class=\"shell__children\">\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Gizi seimbang</span></a>\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">2</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Jadwal imunisasi</span></a>\n          <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"#as2-main\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Air bersih di rumah</span></a>\n        </div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"shell__scrim\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shell__main\">\n    <header class=\"shell__top\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-controls=\"as2-side\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"const s = this.closest('.shell'); const o = !s.classList.contains('is-menu'); s.classList.toggle('is-menu', o); if (o) s.querySelector('.shell__side a').focus();\"><span class=\"burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></button>\n      <span class=\"shell__toptitle\">Memisahkan uang usaha dan pribadi</span>\n      <span style=\"width: 44px;\"></span>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"as2-main\" style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n      <h2 class=\"section__title-sm\">Memisahkan uang usaha dan pribadi</h2>\n      <p class=\"section__sub\">Materi 3 dari Modul 1. Dua dari tiga materi di modul ini sudah selesai.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<nav class=\"shell__nav\" aria-label=\"Materi\">\n  <span class=\"shell__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <div class=\"shell__section\">\n    <button class=\"shell__section-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec-books\">\n      <span class=\"shell__section-label\">Pembukuan usaha</span><span class=\"shell__section-count\">5</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"shell__panel\" id=\"sec-books\"><div>\n      <a class=\"shell__link is-parent\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow\">Modul 1: Arus kas</a>\n      <div class=\"shell__children\">\n        <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow/1\"><span class=\"shell__num\">1</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Mencatat pemasukan</span><span class=\"shell__done\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Selesai</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"shell__link shell__link--child\" href=\"/umkm/cash-flow/3\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"shell__num\">3</span><span class=\"shell__label\">Memisahkan uang usaha dan pribadi</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n</nav>"
